# Comments

Follow the global AI-DO-NOT rules for new comments.

- Prefer clear identifiers. Use short `REQ`, `DESIGN` or `HINT` comments only for non-obvious rationale, requirement references or necessary usage constraints; add no unrequested TODOs.
- Preserve useful requirement references and rationale. Update an affected comment when the authorized change makes it inaccurate; do not require separate permission for routine maintenance.
- Do not delete unrelated comments merely because they lack a prefix. Preserve license notices, tool directives and test-environment annotations.
- Do not add generic headers, section banners or comments that repeat signatures or code.
